{% comment %}
  ==========================================================================
  ZeroStick EXO supported games: ONE list used by every staged EXO page.
  GENERATED by C:\zsg\overhaul\tools\make_games.py (edit the table there
  and re-run, or edit a card here by hand: they are plain HTML).

  Source of truth (checked 2026-11-21):
    ZS CORE\Store info\EXO-LAUNCH-FEATURES.md, section 2 (per-game table)
    app: dashboard/public/sections/05-game-identity.js (GAME_SECTIONS map)
  Counts: 2 Ready, 14 In progress, 13 Planned (29 games).

  Wording rules baked in:
  - "Measured aim curve" ONLY for Black Ops II, MW4 and Warzone.
  - Gun detection only on the 9 games that ship a reader.
  - Hero/operator/agent games ship LISTS only (nothing detects heroes).
  - No rarity, no GPC, no hero detection, no accuracy numbers.
  - Game names as text only (no logos or game art).

  Usage:
    {% render 'zs-exo2-games', mode: 'full' %}     all cards + filter bar
    {% render 'zs-exo2-games', mode: 'teaser' %}   featured cards + name marquee
  ==========================================================================
{% endcomment %}
{%- assign m = mode | default: 'full' -%}
{%- if m == 'full' -%}
  <div class="x2-gamesbar">
    <div class="x2-filter" role="group" aria-label="Filter games by status" data-x2-filter="#x2-games-grid" data-x2-live="#x2-games-live">
      <button type="button" data-value="all" aria-pressed="true">All<span>29</span></button>
      <button type="button" data-value="ready" aria-pressed="false">Ready<span>2</span></button>
      <button type="button" data-value="progress" aria-pressed="false">In progress<span>14</span></button>
      <button type="button" data-value="planned" aria-pressed="false">Planned<span>13</span></button>
    </div>
    <p class="x2-sr" id="x2-games-live" aria-live="polite"></p>
  </div>
{%- endif -%}
